  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds ITextClipboard and managed ContentHubClipboard for native UTF-8 text exchange with Ubuntu Touch apps. The new TextClipboardBridge overload handles Copy/Cut/Paste, preserves undo and field constraints, and rejects late edits after selection or focus changes. Validated with 93 tests and bidirectional Qt/Morph exchange in confined Click 0.1.6 on Fairphone 5. Original phone menus and existing two-argument clipboard integration remain supported. Rich text, images, files and persistence across app exit/reboot are outside the validated scope.",
